{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>You are a stranger in this world. And you will remain a stranger forever.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Embark on a journey across the endless ocean, where every island holds both danger and opportunity. Build a floating fortress, assemble your crew, explore lost lands, and battle ancient creatures lurking in the depths.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Game Features:</strong><br>\ud83c\udf0a <strong>Raft Survival</strong> \u2013 build, upgrade, and defend your floating home.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3537680/extras/052176eec0cc052e26c59105570052fd.poster.avif?t=1753339132\" width=800 height=124 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3537680/extras/052176eec0cc052e26c59105570052fd.webm?t=1753339132\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3537680/extras/052176eec0cc052e26c59105570052fd.mp4?t=1753339132\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfdd <strong>Island Exploration</strong> \u2013 gather resources, uncover secrets, and encounter local inhabitants.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3537680/extras/7d5621a9c1cfd0ab0a29bf2b8fea007f.poster.avif?t=1753339132\" width=800 height=124 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3537680/extras/7d5621a9c1cfd0ab0a29bf2b8fea007f.webm?t=1753339132\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3537680/extras/7d5621a9c1cfd0ab0a29bf2b8fea007f.mp4?t=1753339132\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2694 <strong>Boss Battles</strong> \u2013 fight against mythical beasts guarding the rarest treasures.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3537680/extras/89b7e32e48ac9503169a4703d7b1082e.poster.avif?t=1753339132\" width=800 height=124 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3537680/extras/89b7e32e48ac9503169a4703d7b1082e.webm?t=1753339132\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3537680/extras/89b7e32e48ac9503169a4703d7b1082e.mp4?t=1753339132\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udee0 <strong>Crafting &amp; Resource Management</strong> \u2013 create gear, upgrade weapons, and manage your crew.<br>\ud83d\udc65 <strong>Crew Recruitment</strong> \u2013 gather allies, train them, and send them on missions.<br>\ud83c\udfda <strong>Slave Villages &amp; Upgrades</strong> \u2013 enslave islanders, force them to gather resources, construct buildings, and strengthen your control over the islands. Upgrade settlements to increase production and influence.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you prove that even a stranger can survive? Or will the ocean claim you like all those before you?</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Gifts of the sea","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3537680/1e836d2de2d88e23a8d7adadf42262feb5182883.jpg"},{"name":"Builder","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3537680/dfd9639a3853d34ac9e5bda4efae8b3c5c680f82.jpg"},{"name":"Crafter","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3537680/2d9e2d698562de51d161073090f5e661900d5c39.jpg"},{"name":"OnePunchMan","path":"https://cdn